# INVWINCW.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:WINCOLS.CFG (TEST/WIN/WINCOLS.CFG): column widths kept per table.
# The item list in the stored widths in each order, its bar across; the
# item pick list of F4 in Install, its dialog as wide as its columns;
# the split view, the tree as wide as its stored Name and Type, both
# panes in their tables' widths; the location pick list of Move.  The
# end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINCW.SNP is its snapshot;
# TEST/colchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S ITEMS
K ALT-I L
S BYLOC
K ALT-I S
S BYSER
K ALT-I I DOWN DOWN ALT-C I
T Tandon
K F4
S ITEMPICK
K ENTER ENTER ALT-L B
S LOCS
K ALT-C M
S MOVEPICK
K ESC ALT-F X
